nala (0.17.0~rs1) unstable; urgency=medium

  This package now builds the Rust implementation of Nala.

  The configuration file installed at /etc/nala/nala.conf uses the current HCL
  shape from the Rust codebase.

 -- Blake Lee <blake@volian.org>  Wed, 20 May 2026 00:00:00 -0500

nala (0.15.0) unstable; urgency=medium
  Nala hooks have been removed. You should use apt hooks.

 -- Blake Lee <blake@volian.org>  Tue, 23 Jan 2024 23:37:08 -0600


nala (0.9.0) unstable; urgency=medium
  The configuration file for Nala at `/etc/nala/nala.conf`
  has been changed to toml. This change is BREAKING as the older config
  file will no longer work. Nala will still run with the old config,
  but there will be a syntax error and it will use the program defaults.

 -- Blake Lee <blake@volian.org>  Mon, 23 May 2022 15:53:49 -0400
